    website: "https://roninforge.org"
abstract: >-
  RoninForge claude-code-cost is a Claude Code plugin that reports spend in USD
  per project, per git branch, and over time, without leaving Claude Code. It
  prices the session logs Claude Code already writes using a dated,
  point-in-time price index, so each response is valued at the rate that was
  live on the day it ran. It is MIT licensed, runs entirely on your machine, and
  requires no API keys.
